      "pcm": {
        "channelLayout": "mono",
        "sampleFormat": "s16le",
        "sampleRate": 48000
      },
      "sampleFrameCount": 284160,
      "ttsText": "人工神经网络把这种关系简化成一组数字运算。"
    },
    {
